# Mounted read-only at /models in the api container. Bundles are build outputs of a
# training run, not source: they are large, they are regenerated by
# `scripts/build_model_bundle.py`, and a pickled estimator in git is a binary blob whose
# diff nobody can review. The directory itself is tracked so the bind mount resolves on a
# fresh clone — without it Docker would create a root-owned directory in the working tree.
*
!.gitignore
